  "description": "The proposal comprises the refurbishment and reconfiguration of the existing residential accommodation to provide one self- contained studio and one three-bedroom dwelling (Use Class C3). A change of use is proposed within the rear ground-floor extension only, where a redundant retail unit will be converted to a mezzanine-level studio apartment and associated storage (Use Class E to C3). The scheme includes alterations to roof skylights, extension of the rear lightwell, refurbishment of the shopfront, and replacement and installation of windows to improve daylight and ventilation.",
